As part of effort to stabilize 2.5 kernel, the public web server http://www.osdl.org
has been running 2.5 for over a month.  Yesterday, with the announcement of Linus's
move, the web server went from 30,000 hits a day to 577,000 hits in one day without
a hiccup.

Good work.
